OL,3,GNEWSAFormer Reform councillor joins Lib
OL,4,ADems
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former Reform UK councillor has
OL,7,Fjoined the Liberal Democrats.
OL,9,FKathryn Shaw was first elected to West
OL,10,FNorthamptonshire Council when Reform
OL,11,Ftook overall control from the
OL,12,FConservatives in May 2025.
OL,14,FBut she quit Nigel Farage's party in
OL,15,FMarch, becoming an independent, and has
OL,16,Fnow joined the Lib Dem group.
OL,18,F"Over the past eight months, I've had a
OL,19,Flot of time to reflect on what matters
OL,20,Fmost to me, both as a councillor and as
OL,21,Fa person," said Shaw, who represents
OL,22,FUpton ward.
